            <ArticleTitle>How to succeed at medical interviews.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e21</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/IJ9.0000000000000021</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Few people truly relish being interviewed. But as a professional, you will go through a number of interviews in your life that will affect your career progression. In this article, we provide some tips on how best to prepare for a medical interview, both in terms of your portfolio and interview practice. Advice is also given on how to maximize performance during the interview and gain the most from reflection afterwards.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
